      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marshall%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Marshall Municipal Band, one of Missouri’s oldest tax‑supported bands, has played on the courthouse lawn every summer Thursday since 1921.",
